## Language

- Code, identifiers, comments, tests, logs, commit messages, branch names, PR titles, the changelog,
  file names, plugin names and skill names: English, always. <!-- kept: word -->
- Instructions for AI (this file, skills, tool descriptions): English. <!-- kept: word -->
- Conversation: {{conversation_language}} <!-- kept: word -->
- Documents: {{docs_language}} (README files, decision records, PR descriptions). <!-- kept: word -->
- Text that a skill shows to its user follows that user's language, not this rule. <!-- kept: word -->
